  It's pretty respectable *not* to spoil yourself silly before 
the Ascension run.

  An item can be on top of the portal.


  Watch for monsters disappearing.  (A summoning storm might help
there. ;^)

  Got a magic marker and blank or blankable scrolls?

  How about a crystal ball? 

  I don't think I know what class you're playing, but two classes
have crystal balls as their Quest Artifact.

  How about wishes? 
    Smoky potion and a way to bless it?
    Wand of wishing?
    Magic lamp and a way to bless it?

  Keep an eye out in case any of those are generate randomly
while you're on the Astral Planes.


  If you want to do the work, try this:

    1. Take a sheet of paper and mark off 24x80 grid.
       (Actually, a text file would work better.)
    2. Mark off each square with a monster in it or that
       you've been to.  
    3. Move your character. (To an unmarked square if possible. 
       :-)
    4. Repeat steps 2 and 3 until all squares on right-hand
       side of screen have been marked.
    5. Bang head against wall.
    

  You've still got two more planes before the Astral Plane 
  after you finish the Plane of Air.


